with
`import { chmodSync, existsSync, mkdtempSync, readFileSync, writeFileSync } from "node:fs";`

FORMAT: Then run `cd .skilled/skills/sk-vision/vision-runtime && bunx tsc --noEmit; echo typecheck-exit=$?; bun test src/runtime/client.test.ts 2>&1 | tail -5` and print the output verbatim, nothing else.
